03:10:24,160 --> 03:10:37,160
These uses include all residential uses permitted in zone a pursuant to article two, part B and commercial and non-commercial recreational facilities.

8796
03:10:37,160 --> 03:10:48,160
Zoning ordinance does not define recreational facilities or list campgrounds, motels, or other type of lodging as permitted uses.

8797
03:10:48,160 --> 03:11:14,160
However, section 12, article three, part A states, no overnight camp or motel so called shall be constructed except in a site approved by the board of selectmen and complying with the regulations of the building and zoning code.

